    "source": "UploadList/ListItem itemRender origin, file, items and bound actions",
    "observation": "19 raw visible-content cases for list types/wrap/replace/empty/default, error origin, current fileList order and disabled. Bound preview/download/remove callbacks remain callable from custom controls even with disabled; onRemove=false avoids list mutation. Five renderer transitions. Source origin includes its existing error Tooltip. Svelte counterpart uses an opaque originNode snippet and existing Native controls."
